speechtext:
Yes, Mr. Speaker, I have received such information from the Commissioner of Penitentiaries.
I have requested that an inquiry be held and, moreover, the Commission of Inquiry into the events at Kingston must consider this aspect of the matter. As a matter of fact, paragraph (f) of its terms of reference reads as follows:
(f) what bodily harm was occasioned to persons, whether inmate or staff, during the course of the said disturbances or related thereto, and the identity of the persons responsible for causing such harm;
